      "id": "p0035-b001",
      "kind": "caption",
      "source": {
        "text": "Simple words like \"yes\" and \"no\" don't always work the same way between languages, especially when a negative question is involved. In the literal English translation of this scene, choosing \"yes\" would effectively mean \"no\" and vice versa (Game: Breath of Fire II)",
        "raw": "Simple words like \"yes\"\nand \"no\" don't always\nwork the same way\nbetween languages,\nespecially when a\nnegative question is\ninvolved. In the literal\nEnglish translation of\nthis scene, choosing\n\"yes\" would effectively\nmean \"no\" and vice\nversa (Game: Breath\nof Fire II)",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
